ted with necklines, suspenders, stockings and high gloves.\n\nLeft screen is for the Playful Personalities. These girls like jokes and teasing. They surprise people for fun. Mitsuko and Ino are very playful. Minfilia is less playful.\n- Minfilia Warde (Final Fantasy XIV)\n- Mitsuko Tachibana (Nana to Kaoru)\n- Yamanaka Ino (Naruto Shippuden)\n\nMiddle screen is for Shy Personalities. These girls blush easily. Hard situations make them shy. Hinata is the shyest. L'envie and Nana get shy about private things.\n- L'envie D'aimer (Final Fantasy XIV - https://www.deviantart.com/stash/2s4s8309eih)\n- Chigusa Nana (Nana to Kaoru)\n- Hyuuga Hinata (Naruto Shippuden)\n\nRight screen is for Active / Tomboy Personalities. These girls are strong at sports. They look athletic. Lyse and Sakura fight well. Ryouko runs fast.\n- Lyse Hext (Final Fantasy XIV)\n- Tachi Ryouko (Nana to Kaoru)\n- Haruno Sakura (Naruto Shippuden)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ID0v0/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/afa37a6c/uploads/origins/154dc83d-d713-4663-99eb-7926a28d980b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c80cbe91d90bd47f88d2dc26029f3ea8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afa37a6c/uploads/origins/154dc83d-d713-4663-99eb-7926a28d980b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c80cbe91d90bd47f88d2dc26029f3ea8, https://si.imgix.net/afa37a6c/uploads/origins/154dc83d-d713-4663-99eb-7926a28d980b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ea354e71d696da6041928c44e80d3bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afa37a6c/uploads/origins/154dc83d-d713-4663-99eb-7926a28d980b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bea39c62f1647db229920abf7456714b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "前回のリクエストに引き続き、私のオリジナルキャラクターであるL'envie D'aimerが、ヒナタ、サクラ、イノの3人にチンコを深く挿入している絵をお願いします。\n画面を3分割して、L'envie & サクラ、L'envie & ヒナタ、L'envie & イノが繋がっている絵を描きます。\n焦